        "name": "USN-7824-2",
        "description": "USN-7824-1 fixed several vulnerabilities in Redis. This update provides the corresponding update for Redict - a fork of Redis.  Original advisory details:  Benny Isaacs, Nir Brakha, and Sagi Tzadik discovered that Redis incorrectly handled memory when running Lua scripts. An authenticated attacker could use this vulnerability to trigger a use-after-free condition, and potentially  achieve remote code execution on the Redis server.",
